			"notes": "Features:\n- Weapon and Armor upgrade helper\n  - Highlights the best Armor for each slot depending on defence\n  - Highlights the best Weapon (it uses Damage x Attack speed to determine how good a weapon is)\n- Cheapest item highlight\n  - Highlights the cheapest item in your inventory when picking up an item with a full inventory\n- Inventory crown value\n  - Shows you your total inventory worth\n- Resource pack cache\n  - Caches the resource pack so you dont have to see the loading screen everytime you enter/exit ravengard\n- Weapon damage overlay \n  - Shows you the weapon damage multiplied with its attack speed in the bottom left of a weapon\n- Item crown overlay\n  - Shows you the price of an item in the top left\n- Rarity Backgrounds\n- Fullbright\n- Show your own Nametag"
